      "finding": "Task and binder strings are elaborated after importing each adapter-selected solution module. Pair binding fixes task JSON and frozen sources/catalogs, but no comparison binds the resulting proposition and its contextual dependencies to a prospectively frozen task meaning. Retaining old declaration bodies does not prevent newly added adapter declarations/notation from changing how task text elaborates.",
      "impact": "Valid Lean proofs can answer different mathematical obligations while the comparison reports the same task. A bounded non-solution on the old side does not itself supply an elaborated old target to compare.",
      "acceptance": "Establish a common prospective semantic target/hypothesis context, or a checked relation to it, independently of each adapter. Bind the full context rather than merely a printed proposition or declaration name."
    },
